;##################################################################################
;②キャラ紹介文を書き込み
;##################################################################################

PRINTFORML A tsukumogami transformed from a biwa. She is the older sister of Yatsuhashi Tsukumo,
PRINTFORML though they are technically not blood related, and just became sentient at the same time. 
PRINTFORML She came to life thanks to the power of the Miracle Mallet, but those under its influence had a
PRINTFORML tendency to go berserk, prompting them to go on a rampage in the Shining Needle Castle that hangs
PRINTFORML over Gensokyo, with the goal of creating a world for tsukumogami like herself.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML After discovering that their power was limited by the mallet's magic, they feared that they would
PRINTFORML revert to simple tools once it ran out, but with the help of Raiko Horikawa, they were able to discard
PRINTFORML their old bodies in favor of new ones, allowing them to maintain their existence as tsukumogami,
PRINTFORML living off the magical energy of the Outside World.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Since then, she has been actively involved in live performances with her sister as a [Two Girls Band],
PRINTFORML such as the "Night Parade of Tsukumo (99) Plus One".
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Together with Yatsuhashi, they both dream of a utopia where tools could move freely without the need
PRINTFORML of youkai or humans using them.
RETURN 1